00:06:37.187 --> 00:06:42.767
Four RS-25 engines together produce up to 2 million pounds of thrust for each SLS launch.

00:06:43.307 --> 00:06:45.187
The developmental engine will not fly.

00:06:45.707 --> 00:06:48.367
